@startuml
title Tool Calling Sequence

actor User
participant "Svelte Frontend" as FE
participant "Django API" as API
participant "ToolCallingService" as TOOLS
database "Database" as DB

User -> FE : Ask operational question
FE -> API : POST /api/ai/query-orders/
API -> TOOLS : answer_operational_query(message)
TOOLS -> TOOLS : route to tool
TOOLS -> DB : query operational data
DB --> TOOLS : result rows
TOOLS --> API : tool, arguments, data, answer
API --> FE : response
FE --> User : answer + raw data

@enduml
